date: 2025-12-30T00:00:00-04:00
---

The radar dishes are rooftop receivers. A dish focuses a signal onto a central wire, where a [[Phenomena/Sentience Distributor|sentience distributor]] spreads it into the objects around it; the objects come alive and attack. The dishes are the work of [[Org/Embercall Industries/index|Embercall Industries]], and the signal they receive comes from the [[Org/Gryphonline/index|Gryphonline]] distribution center in Sableclutch.

[[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]] has local gangs install them across the poorer districts, on rooftops over places where crowds gather: the [[Org/Opaline Reserve|Opaline Reserve]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Widdershins/index|Widdershins]], the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]]. One dish, taken from the roof of a roller rink, is kept in the garage at the [[Sin and Tonic]].

[[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn]]'s notes give the dishes a second purpose. They take a harmony from somewhere, emit it, and spread it through everything around them, so that the city vibrates at the same frequency as something far away and lets it come to [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. The dishes are laid out in a hierarchy: many across [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]] point at the [[Org/Gryphonline/index|Gryphonline]] distribution center, which in turn points at a spot within [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]].
